menu "Robot head controller"
config ROBOT_HEAD_REMOTE
    bool "Control display and gimbal through Luckfox / STM32F103"
    default y
    help
        Enable for the new wiring. Never disable this while the camera is
        connected to the former display/servo GPIOs: legacy drivers would
        drive camera data pins. Remote UART uses GPIO9 TX / GPIO18 RX.
endmenu
